VPlease note that we have no possibility to know if you delete a Game from your device and your personal data will thus be stored by us even if you delete a Game.
p9
I1
sVIn those cases, you do not have to provide that personal data to us or have the right to opt out from such use (if the same type of data is used also for other purposes).
p10
I1
sVPersonal Data may be freely provided by the User, or, in case of Usage Data, collected automatically when using our apps.
p11
I1
sVComplete details on each type of Personal Data collected are provided in the dedicated sections of this privacy policy or by specific explanation texts displayed prior to the Data collection.
p12
I1
sVThe Policy describes how we collect and use information, including personal data (the "Data"), about you
p13
I1
sVIf you do not want us to use such information at all, please do not sign into any of our Apps through your social network.
p14
I1
sVWe use this data for example to be able to provide the Apps to you and show advertisements for the purpose of monetization.
p15
I1
sVBelow follows a more detailed description on how we and our partners use personal data.
p16
I1
sVYou have the right to object to how we use your personal data and you also have other rights to gain insight into and influence how we use your personal data.
p17
I2
sVWhen you play one of our Games we will save some information about the Apps you used, general activities in the App and for how long you used that App.
p18
I1
sVIn addition to the information contained in this privacy policy, the Apps may provide the User with additional and contextual information concerning particular Services or the collection and processing of Personal Data upon request.
p19
I1
sVThis information is used for analytics of how the App works and to be enable us to improve the App.
p20
I1
sVIf any such transfer takes place, Users can find out more by checking the relevant sections of this document or inquire with the Owner using the information provided in the contact section.
p21
I1
sVWe only use the types of data that are necessary for our Apps to provide the requested functionality, like the Facebook ID.
